ask: Can the refusal's full cause and recovery guidance be read at every supported size while its job counts stay unchanged?
resize: 120x36
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/finite_policy.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restore
keys: Escape
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 BATCH | restored-source-plan
nav-mode:
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 dispatcher pid | started
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/finite_policy.py @TMP_TARGET @ART completed
keys: r
require-live-snap: 30 completed 3 / planned 3 | completed-study
ask: Does the real controller execute exactly three approved policy passes with one worker, retain three observations and preserve the protected call capacity?
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 30 Viewing Scan | scan-result
nav-mode:
keys: n
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Review | accepted-scan
submit: open F-0001
require-live-snap: 25 Package manifest does not declare a license | policy-finding
expect: signal-only
submit: decision deferred Owned package policy needs an owner decision
require-live-snap: 25 Owned package policy needs an owner decision | deferred
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Enter export | report
keys: p
require-live-snap: 25 REPORT | report-preview
