ask: Does the report preserve the three-pass denominator, signal-only evidence and scripted deferral without upgrading repetition into confidence or a fix claim?
resize: 120x36
keys: j j j
require-live-snap: 20 format json (4/6) | json-format
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | exported
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/finite_policy.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exported
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 completed 3 / planned 3 | restored-study
submit: open F-0001
require-live-snap: 25 Owned package policy needs an owner decision | restored-decision
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/finite_policy.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart retain the approved workload, source/context identity, observations, decision and report without launching another job or consuming provider capacity?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
